// "Resists magical effects more easily and slips free of spells that would
// seize them" -- there is no advantage-on-save-vs-spells primitive, nor a
// magic-only damage-kind filter (`ProtectingWard`'s own reduction is kind-
// agnostic, per blade_ward.ron's precedent), so this ships as the same flat
// `ProtectingWard` damage-reduction ward every other Abjuration self-ward in
// this file uses, read here as "a general defensive lattice" rather than a
// save-specific bonus.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: ProtectingWard, data: BuffData(strength: 0.2, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 30.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
